<title>DENMARK: Denmark's KommuneKredit issues new four pct bond.</title>
<headline>Denmark's KommuneKredit issues new four pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead managers Gudme Raaschou and Jyske Bank JYBCb.CO on Tuesday.</p>
<p>BORROWER KOMMUNEKREDIT</p>
<p>AMT 331.25 MLN DKK</p>
<p>COUPON 4.00</p>
<p>MATURITY SEVEN YRS</p>
<p>TYPE STRAIGHT</p>
<p>ISS PRICE UNDISC</p>
<p>DATE 3 FEB. 1997</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
